{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33990","headline":"寄滑州李副使员外 · 皮日休","name":"寄滑州李副使员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵绕临淮数十重，铁衣才子正从公。\n军前草奏旄头下，城上封书箭𦼮中\n围合只应闻晓雁，血腥何处避春风。\n故人勳重金章贵，犹在江湖积劒功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}